{"seq":19,"slug":"mobile-widget-live-activities","title":"移动小组件与实时活动","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities","rating":{"composite":4.12,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"移动小组件与实时活动-简介\">移动小组件与实时活动 简介</h1><p>移动小组件（Widget）和实时活动（Live Activity）是用户与应用交互的&quot;第二屏面&quot;——它们将关键信息直接呈现在主屏、锁屏、动态岛等系统级界面，让用户无需打开应用即可获取状态、执行操作。一个设计精良的小组件能显著提升用户留存和日常活跃度，而实时活动则为外卖配送、体育比赛、航班追踪等时效性场景提供了原生的实时展示能力。</p>\n<p>本手册是面向有 iOS/Android 基础开发经验的工程师的完整开发指南，覆盖两大平台的小组件框架和实时活动系统。iOS 端涵盖 WidgetKit 的声明式构建、Timeline Provider 数据驱动、AppIntent 交互能力，以及 ActivityKit 实时活动与 Dynamic Island 动态岛的设计与实现；Android 端涵盖传统 AppWidgetProvider + RemoteViews 方案和现代 Jetpack Glance 声明式框架，以及尺寸适配、状态管理和更新调度的工程实践。</p>\n<p>四条主线贯穿全文：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基础</strong>（第一章）：WidgetKit 与 AppWidget 的架构对比、生命周期模型、刷新机制与系统节流策略。理解 widget 进程的独立运行特性和数据共享方式，是一切开发的起点。</li>\n<li><strong>实时活动</strong>（第二章）：ActivityKit 的 ActivityAttributes/ContentState 模型、动态岛的紧凑态/最小态/展开态设计、本地更新与 APNs 推送更新的策略选择。实时活动不是&quot;会动的 widget&quot;，而是一套独立的事件驱动系统。</li>\n<li><strong>UI 设计</strong>（第三章）：尺寸变体的渐进披露信息架构、色彩与排版的系统协调、可访问性的语义化标记实践。好的 widget 设计不在于展示多少信息，而在于在有限空间内传达最核心的价值。</li>\n<li><strong>工程实践</strong>（第四章）：Timeline Provider 的批量预计算策略、调试工具链与测试方法、App Store 配置与用户引导。将 widget 从&quot;能跑&quot;提升到&quot;好用&quot;，需要工程层面的系统性思考。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>阅读本手册前，你应该具备：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>iOS 基础开发经验（SwiftUI 或 UIKit）</li>\n<li>Android 基础开发经验（Jetpack Compose 或传统 View 系统）</li>\n<li>对应用扩展（App Extension / BroadcastReceiver）的基本了解</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推荐的学习路径是先通读第一章建立两大平台的架构认知，再根据你的目标平台选择性深入第二章（如果需要实时活动能力）或第三章（如果需要优化视觉设计），最后通过第四章的工程实践将知识落地到真实项目中。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"widget-foundations","title":"小组件基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"widgetkit-ios","title":"iOS WidgetKit 小组件开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-foundations/widgetkit-ios"},{"seq":2,"slug":"appwidget-android","title":"Android AppWidget 与 Jetpack Glance","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-foundations/appwidget-android"},{"seq":3,"slug":"widget-lifecycle","title":"小组件生命周期与刷新机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-foundations/widget-lifecycle"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"live-activities","title":"实时活动与动态岛","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/live-activities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"activitykit-live-activities","title":"ActivityKit 与实时活动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/live-activities/activitykit-live-activities"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-island","title":"动态岛设计与交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/live-activities/dynamic-island"},{"seq":3,"slug":"live-activity-updates","title":"实时活动更新策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/live-activities/live-activity-updates"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"widget-ui-design","title":"小组件UI设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-ui-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"widget-size-variants","title":"小组件尺寸变体与适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-ui-design/widget-size-variants"},{"seq":2,"slug":"widget-color-typography","title":"小组件色彩与排版","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-ui-design/widget-color-typography"},{"seq":3,"slug":"widget-accessibility","title":"小组件可访问性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-ui-design/widget-accessibility"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"widget-engineering","title":"小组件工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"widget-data-provider","title":"数据提供与 Timeline","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-engineering/widget-data-provider"},{"seq":2,"slug":"widget-testing-debugging","title":"测试与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-engineering/widget-testing-debugging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"widget-app-store","title":"上架与用户引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-engineering/widget-app-store"}]}]}